        "monster": "schatten",
        "gefuehl": "angst",
        "aktion": "zittert"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In nineteen sixty-four, a student named Randy Gardner stayed awake for *eleven days*.",
      "szene": {
        "typ": "jahr",
        "jahr": 1964,
        "text": "Record",
        "objekt": "🏆",
        "stempel": "verified"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He got moody, forgetful, and at times saw things that weren't there.",
      "szene": {
        "typ": "akte",
